{"generalSituation":"Winds will be weak over the coast of Guangdong in the next couple of days. Meanwhile, the broad band of clouds over central China will move southwards slightly. There will be a few showers over the coast of Guangdong early next week. With the band of clouds thinning out, the weather will be generally fine over southern China midweek next week. The northeast monsoon is expected to affect southern China in the middle and latter parts of next week. A broad area of low pressure may develop gradually over the central part of the South China Sea in the latter part of next week, and will bring unsettled weather to the region. Besides, Tropical Cyclone Krovanh will linger over the vicinity of the Ryukyu Islands in the next couple of days.","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20260905","week":"Saturday","forecastWind":"West to southwest force 2 to 3.","forecastWeather":"Sunny periods. Isolated showers later.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":31,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":60,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":51,"PSR":"Low"},{"forecastDate":"20260906","week":"Sunday","forecastWind":"Light winds force 2.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with a few showers. Sunny intervals during the day.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":31,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":95,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":70,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":54,"PSR":"Medium"},{"forecastDate":"20260907","week":"Monday","forecastWind":"Light winds force 2.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with one or two showers. Sunny intervals during the day.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":32,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":27,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":90,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":65,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":54,"PSR":"Medium Low"},{"forecastDate":"20260908","week":"Tuesday","forecastWind":"Light winds force 2.","forecastWeat